/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
/* clipboard.rasi  —  cliphist picker                                        */
/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

/* Palette comes from wallust; see wallust/templates/rofi.rasi in the repo. */
@import "colours.rasi"

configuration {
    display-dmenu: "󰅍  Clip";
}

* {
    background-color: transparent;
    text-color:       @fg0;
    border:           0;
    margin:           0;
    padding:          0;
    spacing:          0;
}

window {
    width:            750px;
    background-color: @bg0;
    border:           1px;
    border-color:     @border-col;
    border-radius:    12px;
}

mainbox {
    orientation:      vertical;
    spacing:          0;
    children:         [ inputbar, listview ];
}

inputbar {
    orientation:      horizontal;
    background-color: @bg1;
    border-radius:    12px 12px 0 0;
    padding:          10px 14px;
    spacing:          10px;
    border:           0 0 1px 0;
    border-color:     @border-col;
    children:         [ prompt, entry ];
    expand:           false;
}

prompt {
    text-color:       @accent;
    font:             "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Bold 13";
    vertical-align:   0.5;
}

entry {
    text-color:       @fg0;
    placeholder:      "Search clipboard…";
    placeholder-color:@fg1;
    cursor:           text;
    vertical-align:   0.5;
    expand:           true;
}

listview {
    layout:           vertical;
    spacing:          1px;
    padding:          8px;
    lines:            8;
    scrollbar:        false;
    fixed-height:     false;
    dynamic:          true;
}

element {
    orientation:      horizontal;
    border-radius:    8px;
    padding:          8px 12px;
    cursor:           pointer;
}

element normal normal   { text-color: @fg0; }
element alternate normal { text-color: @fg0; }
element selected normal { 
    background-color: @selected-bg; 
    text-color: @fg0; 
    border: 0 0 0 2px; 
    border-color: @accent;
}
element selected active { background-color: @selected-bg; text-color: @accent; }

element-text {
    vertical-align:   0.5;
    text-color:       inherit;
}
